Package: kaede-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Kaede Chat contributors
Depends: libasound2, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libxdo3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kaede-chat/kaede-chat
Description: Native client for federated Kaede Chat instances
 Kaede Desktop provides communities, direct messages, media, moderation,
 federation, and native voice/video through a Slint interface.
